---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy — Seddly" description="Seddly is built privacy-first. Screenshots never leave your device. Here's exactly how your data works.">
  <section class="page-header">
    <h1>How Your Data Works</h1>
    <p>Seddly is built privacy-first. Here's exactly what happens with your data — in plain English.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="privacy-flow">
    <div class="flow-section">
      <h2>What stays on your device</h2>
      <div class="flow-items on-device">
        <div class="flow-item">
          <span class="icon">&#x1F4F1;</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Your screenshot images</h3>
            <p>Screenshot files never leave your iPhone. We read pixels, extract text, and that's it. The image stays in your Photos app.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-item">
          <span class="icon">&#x1F50D;</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Text extraction (OCR)</h3>
            <p>All text recognition runs on-device using Apple's Vision framework. No network call needed.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-item">
          <span class="icon">&#x1F4CB;</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Your commitment ledger</h3>
            <p>All commitments, entities, deadlines, and notes are stored locally on your device using SwiftData.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flow-section">
      <h2>What is processed in the cloud (Pro only)</h2>
      <div class="flow-items cloud">
        <div class="flow-item">
          <span class="icon">&#x1F4AC;</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Text snippets for AI analysis</h3>
            <p>When the AI analyzes a screenshot, only the extracted text is sent — not the image. No name, email, or device ID is attached. You can review exactly what's sent before it goes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flow-section">
      <h2>What Seddly never does</h2>
      <div class="flow-items never">
        <div class="flow-item"><p>Never uploads your screenshots or images</p></div>
        <div class="flow-item"><p>Never accesses your personal photos or videos</p></div>
        <div class="flow-item"><p>Never reads screenshots in the background without showing you</p></div>
        <div class="flow-item"><p>Never shares data with third parties</p></div>
        <div class="flow-item"><p>Never requires an account for free or Pro tiers</p></div>
        <div class="flow-item"><p>Never tracks you across apps or websites</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="privacy-label">
    <h2>App Store Privacy Label</h2>
    <div class="label-grid">
      <div class="label-card">
        <h3>Data Linked to You</h3>
        <p>None (Free &amp; Pro)<br/>Identifiers + Usage Data (Pro+ with account)</p>
      </div>
      <div class="label-card">
        <h3>Data Used to Track You</h3>
        <p>None</p>
      </div>
      <div class="label-card">
        <h3>Data Not Linked to You</h3>
        <p>Diagnostics</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-link">
    <p>For the full legal privacy policy, see <a href="/privacy/legal">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 6rem 2rem 3rem;
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .page-header p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .privacy-flow {
    max-width: 750px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }

  .flow-section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .flow-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .flow-items {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .flow-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.2rem;
  }

  .on-device .flow-item {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-success);
  }

  .cloud .flow-item {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-warning);
  }

  .never .flow-item {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-danger);
  }

  .icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .flow-item h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .flow-item p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .privacy-label {
    max-width: 750px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .privacy-label h2 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .label-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .label-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .label-card h3 {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .label-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .legal-link {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .label-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
